Package: panelSCM
Title: A Synthetic Control Approach to Estimate Heterogeneous Treatment Effects with Panel Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Jona-Frederik", "Baumert", role = "aut"),
      person("Morten", "Harmening", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "m.harmening@ipw.uni-hannover.de")
    )
Description: Implements a panel-data extension of the Synthetic Control Method
    to estimate heterogeneous treatment effects. The approach constructs
    unit-specific synthetic controls, aligns individual treatment effects on a
    relative time scale, and estimates heterogeneous average treatment effects
    using kernel density estimation and highest density regions. The methodology
    is described in Baumert and Harmening (forthcoming).
